  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of the Education Sector</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Modernizacin Sector Educacin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WILL HAVE THREE SUBCOMPONENTS: (1) TO INCREASE COVERAGE AND STRENGTHEN SERVICIES IN PRESCHOOL AND BASIC EDUCATION IN RURAL AREAS; (2) TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF THE PRESCHOOL AND BASIC EDUCATION; AND (3) TO PROMOTE INSTITUTIONAL MODERNIZATION OF THE MOE. THE PROJECT WILL BE COFINANCED WITH THE WORLD BANK. THE JOINT FINANCING WILL BE ACCOMPLISHED IN PARALLEL FORM AND IN EQUAL PERCENTAGES FOR BOTH BANKS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
